=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/18_15964671856a87e993e81be.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/19_5805941886a87e9989b520.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/20_12277697396a87e9bfe65b5.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/21_16818937846a87e9e6990f2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/22_13583971596a87e9eb74ab1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/23_13235484756a87eb2e6c3d6.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/24_14660172626a87eb32c1f28.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/25_4775365336a87eb3838a65.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/26_880167336a87eb3c87a39.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/27_4366904906a87eb40283fa.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/28_1099352776a87eb43c63c8.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/29_9910626986a87eb47a7894.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/30_2820141076a87eb4c9d4b9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/31_8159699596a87eb8c820af.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/32_1840033106a87eb915d132.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/33_1038164306a87ebb2d47e2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/34_5327316006a87ebd67fabc.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/35_2223940866a87ebf767602.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/36_9795373626a87ec2a42ba2.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>還有什麼演唱會消息？</p><p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇： 演唱會時間表及購票資訊 ，包括 MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排 、 容祖兒 、 鄭秀文 、 張學友 、 鄭中基 、 溫拿 、 羅志祥 等。</p><p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？</p><p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看 Netflix劇集 和 BL劇 最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些 室內好去處 室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇： 離島行程攻略 或是行山，這些 行山好去處 路線簡易，新手也適合。</p><p>Tags : tvb即時資訊 亞馬遜 南美潮什麼2 梁芷珮</p><p>圖片來源：TVB 資料或影片來源： 原文刊於新假期</p><p>Aug 21 2026</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-21T07:48:32.318210+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1419,"images":38,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none"}}